/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
.DS_Store

# Scratch/reference dumps — ignore `tmp` directories at any level
tmp/

# Ad-hoc session batch/workflow driver scripts — scratch automation, not repo content
/.workflows/

# cyrup-ext-subagents runtime state — project-scoped by upstream design (pi-subagents'
# `.pi-subagents` default, `PROJECT_ARTIFACT_ROOT`; see docs/gap-analysis/09-cyrup-ext-subagents.md
# §SUBA-072 for why `.cyrup-subagents/` itself is correct-as-is, not a bug) but never repo content —
# upstream's own artifacts.ts tells consumers to .npmignore/.gitignore the equivalent directory.
.cyrup-subagents/
# Per-attempt raw-stdout tee scratch dir (docs/gap-analysis/bugs/SUBA-072-scratch-dir-project-scope.md
# tracks relocating this under the global `~/.cyrup`/OS-temp root instead of the project cwd; ignored
# here in the meantime so it does not show up as untracked noise or get committed by accident).
.cyrup-subagent-scratch/
